{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vampirelands",
    "steam_appid": 1724170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful World</h2><br>Immerse yourself in a world filled with detailed and stunning locations, teeming with creatures of all kinds and a wealth of mysteries waiting to be uncovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master your Shadowhunter</h2><br>Become a skilled Shadowhunter, wielding a variety of ranged weapons and unique abilities to fight enemies. Improve your skills to unleash your full potential and dominate the battlefield.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skills</h2><br>Choose from several character classes, including Saints, Hunters, Vampires, and Undead, each with their own abilities for attacking, defending, and surviving. Customize your character with a variety of passive and active abilities to create your own unique playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Loot</h2><br>Experience a loot generation system that generates truly unique and interesting items for your Night Hunter. Find new items by defeating enemies and bosses or by searching chests scattered throughout levels. The battles with bosses will be a thrilling trek in search of the best items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><br>Fight a variety of enemies, both monsters and humans, adapting to their unique fighting styles. Utilize a range of weapons and abilities to create a thrilling combat experience that will keep you engaged.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic change of day and night</h2><br>Experience the dynamic change of day and night, utilizing your skills to adapt to the environment. During the day, hide in the shade to avoid the scorching sun, and at night, crush enemies without fear of light. You can even use abilities to not be afraid of the sun or switch day/night for strategic advantages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><br>Team up with friends to collect loot and complete quests together, or compete against each other in challenging multiplayer modes.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful World</h2><br>Immerse yourself in a world filled with detailed and stunning locations, teeming with creatures of all kinds and a wealth of mysteries waiting to be uncovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master your Shadowhunter</h2><br>Become a skilled Shadowhunter, wielding a variety of ranged weapons and unique abilities to fight enemies. Improve your skills to unleash your full potential and dominate the battlefield.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skills</h2><br>Choose from several character classes, including Saints, Hunters, Vampires, and Undead, each with their own abilities for attacking, defending, and surviving. Customize your character with a variety of passive and active abilities to create your own unique playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Loot</h2><br>Experience a loot generation system that generates truly unique and interesting items for your Night Hunter. Find new items by defeating enemies and bosses or by searching chests scattered throughout levels. The battles with bosses will be a thrilling trek in search of the best items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><br>Fight a variety of enemies, both monsters and humans, adapting to their unique fighting styles. Utilize a range of weapons and abilities to create a thrilling combat experience that will keep you engaged.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic change of day and night</h2><br>Experience the dynamic change of day and night, utilizing your skills to adapt to the environment. During the day, hide in the shade to avoid the scorching sun, and at night, crush enemies without fear of light. You can even use abilities to not be afraid of the sun or switch day/night for strategic advantages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><br>Team up with friends to collect loot and complete quests together, or compete against each other in challenging multiplayer modes.",
    "short_description": "Play an exciting top-down action RPG and become an unbeatable Night Hunter. You will have to fight alone or with friends, unlocking new abilities and obtaining unique weapons and equipment from the generated loot. Be a true hero and defeat the darkness in this thrilling world!",
